			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"古尔根",
					"瓦尔坦"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230230101,
					"content": "这样下去可不行啊，爸，蔷薇的长势实在不行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230102,
					"content": "得赶快想想办法，不然今年我们就没法按时交付所有草药了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230103,
					"content": "土壤没问题，杂草和害虫也都除了，这到底是怎么回事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230104,
					"content": "你们在发什么愁呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230105,
					"content": "嗯？你是来购买草药的客人吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230106,
					"content": "事情是这样的，每隔一段时间，我们都会向「健康之家」提供一批草药。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230107,
					"content": "其中最重要的就是这株特别的「须弥蔷薇」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230108,
					"content": "原来蔷薇也可以入药吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230109
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230109,
					"content": "这就要问「健康之家」的医生们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230110,
					"content": "反正他们说，这种蔷薇和其他药物搭配后可以治疗中暑，对胃病也有缓解的效果，还有一些其他的功效…我也记不清了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230111,
						230230113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230111,
					"content": "既然如此，我会帮忙的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230112,
					"content": "真是太感谢了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230113,
					"content": "这一株蔷薇怎么了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230114,
					"content": "不知道怎么回事，这株蔷薇生长得很缓慢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230115,
					"content": "按照我们以往的经验，出现这种情况，要么是土壤出了问题，要么就是有虫害。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230116,
					"content": "不过，我们之前刚用这种土壤种了一批草药，那批草药的长势可好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230117,
					"content": "我们每天都会除虫，虫害更是谈不上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230118,
					"content": "唉，不过现在也不能纠结这种问题，再拖下去，这一株蔷薇就不能按时交给「健康之家」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "古尔根"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230119,
					"content": "所以我们计划，总之先用特制的肥料给土壤增肥…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230120,
					"content": "但我们两个人还要去打理其他药田，根本没空再去搜集制作肥料所需的材料。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230121,
					"content": "旅行者，就算是为了「健康之家」的病人们…可以请你帮我们这个忙吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230122,
					"content": "我会帮忙的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230230123,
					"content": "真是太感谢了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230230124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				},
				{
					"id": 230230124,
					"content": "让我看看现在的情况…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "瓦尔坦"
				}
			]
		},
